{"symbol":"ISDMR.IS","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T18:22:04Z","info":{"address1":"Karayilan Mahallesi","address2":"Hatay","city":"Iskenderun","zip":"31319","country":"Turkey","website":"https://www.isdemir.com.tr","industry":"Steel","industryKey":"steel","industryDisp":"Steel","sector":"Basic Materials","sectorKey":"basic-materials","sectorDisp":"Basic Materials","longBusinessSummary":"Iskenderun Demir ve Çelik A.S. produces and sells flat steel products in Turkey. The company offers hot-rolled flat steel products, including rolled or steel sheets, plate steels, deep drawable steels, wheel and chassis steels, general structural steels, hot rolled pipe steels, pressure vessels and hot rolled steels for pressure purposes, hot rolled steel for welded gas cylinders, and medium and high strength shipbuilding steels. It also provides long products, such as thin wires, welding wires, tire wires, fasteners, PC strands, and springs; and billets used for coil, construction steel, profile, rail, and seamless pipe manufacturing. In addition, the company offers by-products comprising engine and pure benzol, toluene, xylol, crude tar, ammonium sulfate (artificial fertilizer), iron sulfate, coke, oxygen, nitrogen, argon, ammonium sulphate, granulated slag, tar and benzol. Further, it provides after-sales, laboratory and calibration, steel service center, and port services. It exports its products. Iskenderun Demir ve Çelik A.S. was incorporated in 1968 and is headquartered in Iskenderun, Turkey. Iskenderun Demir ve Çelik A.S. is a subsidiary of Eregli Demir ve Çelik Fabrikalari T.A.S.","fullTimeEmployees":4904,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ayhan  Akin","age":55,"title":"General Manager","yearBorn":1970,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Mehmet  Pehlivan","title":"Executive VP of Financial Affairs & Purchasing","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Emrah  Silav","title":"Group Chief Financial Officer","exerci